      en: ["Part of the Orheiul Vechi reservation, a candidate for UNESCO World Heritage.", "Famous for its cave monastery dating back to the 13th century (Peștera).", "Most traditional peasant houses date from the 19th century.", "The village is situated in a gorge carved by the Răut River.", "Thracian fortifications from the 1st millennium BC were discovered here.", "The stone cross on the hill is considered the spiritual center of the area."],
