      en: ["The Maiac radio center was constructed between 1968 and 1971.", "The facility's most powerful transmitters had an output of up to 1000 kilowatts.", "In April 2022, two of the main antennas were destroyed during regional tensions.", "The memorial honors over 150 village residents who fell in World War II.", "Maiac is located approximately 12 kilometers east of the Nistru (Dniester) River.", "The facility was used to broadcast Soviet programs to Western Europe and America."],
