      en: ["Tvardița was founded on September 22, 1830, by Bulgarian refugees.", "The museum houses over 5000 exhibits related to ethnographic history.", "The town is famous for 'Tvardița' brandy, which is exported internationally.", "There is a special section dedicated to the Bulgarian independence movement.", "A large Bulgarian folklore festival takes place annually near the museum.", "The Bulgarian language is maintained in Tvardița as a vibrant everyday language."],
